[API Documentation]
Applies the element-wise PReLU function.

    .. math::
        \text{PReLU}(x) = \max(0,x) + a * \min(0,x)

    or

    .. math::
        \text{PReLU}(x) =
        \begin{cases}
        x, & \text{ if } x \ge 0 \\
        ax, & \text{ otherwise }
        \end{cases}

